WEBVTT

00:15.110 --> 00:15.910
Your Majesty.

00:17.710 --> 00:20.190
Are you still thinking
about the marriage alliance?

00:20.320 --> 00:22.230
I have so many daughters.

00:23.030 --> 00:24.600
Which one should I send?

00:25.830 --> 00:28.390
This alliance concerns
the fate of the empire.

00:28.600 --> 00:31.480
(Le Tribe)
I wouldn't dare speak out of turn.

00:34.000 --> 00:35.320
I'm not sending any of them.

00:35.710 --> 00:36.470
Your Majesty!

00:37.070 --> 00:38.390
Please reconsider.

00:38.390 --> 00:40.710
The tradition of marriage alliances

00:40.710 --> 00:43.560
has continued for nearly a century.

00:43.960 --> 00:45.320
If we suddenly put an end to it,

00:45.600 --> 00:46.430
the Le Tribe

00:46.710 --> 00:49.030
may not let this go so easily.

00:49.200 --> 00:50.350
So what?

00:51.240 --> 00:52.470
Peace or war,

00:53.070 --> 00:55.320
I'm ready for either.

01:04.432 --> 01:05.480
What are you doing here?

02:46.900 --> 02:47.696
=Blossoms of Power=

02:47.696 --> 02:50.570
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

02:50.580 --> 02:53.540
=Episode 19=

02:53.910 --> 02:54.680
Father.

02:55.280 --> 02:55.960
I...

02:55.960 --> 02:56.680
Silence!

02:58.310 --> 03:01.910
After bringing such shame
upon the royal family,

03:02.400 --> 03:04.710
how dare you weep before me?

03:10.870 --> 03:11.520
Your Majesty.

03:12.030 --> 03:14.310
Princess Pingling and I

03:14.448 --> 03:15.560
fell in love at first sight.

03:15.888 --> 03:17.470
We simply couldn't help ourselves.

03:18.520 --> 03:20.120
If anyone deserves punishment,

03:20.750 --> 03:22.310
it should be me, not the princess.

03:34.000 --> 03:34.840
I...

03:35.960 --> 03:37.960
I'm in love with Prince Munuha.

03:40.190 --> 03:42.710
Princess Pingling's marriage
to Munuha is finalized.

03:45.000 --> 03:46.288
What happened between them

03:46.320 --> 03:47.520
is known throughout the court.

03:47.520 --> 03:48.688
She has no other choice now.

03:49.360 --> 03:50.750
She tried to set you up that night,

03:51.000 --> 03:52.430
but it backfired on her instead.

03:53.240 --> 03:55.560
Besides, Father has always
despised marriage alliances.

03:56.750 --> 03:57.520
He believes

03:58.190 --> 04:00.400
that sacrificing a woman's future
for peace

04:01.030 --> 04:02.680
is nothing but a man's cowardice.

04:03.952 --> 04:05.960
Once a woman is married
off to a foreign tribe,

04:05.960 --> 04:07.470
she can never return home.

04:08.030 --> 04:08.800
Six years ago,

04:09.200 --> 04:12.064
Princess Yun'an, who was sent to
the Le Tribe for a marriage alliance,

04:12.120 --> 04:12.840
died there.

04:14.430 --> 04:15.520
Princess Yun'an?

04:17.920 --> 04:19.390
She grew up in the palace.

04:19.392 --> 04:21.632
She was not only the late
emperor's adopted daughter,

04:21.640 --> 04:23.310
but also Father's true love.

04:23.376 --> 04:25.510
But because she was
forced into a marriage alliance,

04:25.536 --> 04:27.008
they never saw each other again.

04:28.390 --> 04:29.830
Father opposes marriage alliances

04:29.920 --> 04:31.920
because he has felt
that very pain himself.

04:32.870 --> 04:34.430
How do you know

04:34.430 --> 04:35.680
about all this?

04:37.950 --> 04:39.000
If one wishes to know,

04:39.360 --> 04:41.040
one finds a way to uncover the truth.

04:43.680 --> 04:44.480
Fair enough.

04:45.040 --> 04:47.480
I nearly forgot your formidable methods.

04:50.800 --> 04:51.870
You're the only one

04:52.190 --> 04:53.240
who fears neither thunder

04:53.312 --> 04:54.800
nor longs for the spring breeze.

04:54.920 --> 04:56.120
You're impossible to win over.

05:29.120 --> 05:29.720
Look.

05:31.070 --> 05:32.600
Even the flowers adore you.

05:33.750 --> 05:35.510
How can you blame me for not letting go?

05:50.190 --> 05:51.560
Take a look at this fabric!

05:51.560 --> 05:52.800
It's incredibly soft.

05:52.800 --> 05:54.270
Come on, have a look!

05:54.360 --> 05:55.480
Your Highness, look!

05:55.480 --> 05:56.630
It's so lively!

05:57.870 --> 05:59.430
I'd heard that foreign merchants

05:59.430 --> 06:00.880
set up a market outside the capital.

06:01.120 --> 06:02.680
It only opens once a month.

06:02.920 --> 06:05.040
I didn't expect it to be this bustling.

06:05.190 --> 06:07.950
The spices you couldn't
find in the capital,

06:07.950 --> 06:09.360
I'm sure we'll find them here today.

06:11.510 --> 06:12.270
Your Highness,

06:12.270 --> 06:13.510
the spice shop is this way.

06:25.800 --> 06:26.680
Your Highness,

06:26.750 --> 06:28.000
what flower is this?

06:28.630 --> 06:29.750
Slender-Leaf Qionghua.

06:30.190 --> 06:31.430
You have a good eye, miss.

06:32.000 --> 06:33.870
There are several varieties of Qionghua,

06:33.870 --> 06:35.800
but this one's the rarest.

06:35.800 --> 06:36.850
It's incredibly delicate.

06:36.870 --> 06:39.240
Once it's transplanted, it wilts easily.

06:39.480 --> 06:41.270
I brought nearly ten with me,

06:41.440 --> 06:42.830
and cared for them meticulously.

06:42.920 --> 06:44.600
Only this one survived.

06:44.680 --> 06:45.630
Zhen Zhu, pay her.

06:50.240 --> 06:52.870
Why did you suddenly buy
a Slender-Leaf Qionghua?

06:53.240 --> 06:55.240
It wasn't on the shopping list.

06:58.140 --> 06:59.420
(Scented Fans)

06:59.430 --> 07:00.070
Young Lady,

07:00.270 --> 07:01.560
would you like a scented fan?

07:01.920 --> 07:04.040
We have agarwood, white
musk, and cedarwood.

07:06.240 --> 07:06.920
Shopkeeper,

07:07.390 --> 07:09.430
do you happen to have
a Shuisheng incense fan?

07:09.430 --> 07:10.800
How did you know?

07:15.310 --> 07:16.390
I'll take this one.

07:16.510 --> 07:17.560
I'm sorry.

07:17.800 --> 07:19.390
Shuisheng incense is quite rare.

07:19.560 --> 07:21.750
This fan has been reserved.

07:21.750 --> 07:22.750
It's the only one.

07:23.070 --> 07:24.830
Why don't you take a look at the others?

07:26.270 --> 07:26.950
It's fine then.

07:27.070 --> 07:28.270
I was simply too late.

07:29.630 --> 07:30.390
If you like it,

07:31.720 --> 07:32.510
it's yours.

07:33.360 --> 07:34.310
You're here, sir.

07:35.680 --> 07:36.680
Your custom-made fan.

07:44.750 --> 07:46.430
Qingzhi loved this scent.

07:46.800 --> 07:48.950
I order one every year.

07:53.510 --> 07:55.070
Thank you for your kindness, Prince Xin,

07:55.184 --> 07:57.120
but I can't take what
someone else treasures.

08:20.190 --> 08:21.750
Prince Xin is unbelievable.

08:21.830 --> 08:23.600
He knows you and
Her Highness are engaged,

08:23.600 --> 08:25.510
yet he still won't give up on her.

08:27.750 --> 08:28.950
Why did Her Highness accept it?

08:32.000 --> 08:33.270
When the moon shines bright,

08:33.840 --> 08:35.270
people can't help but admire it.

08:35.720 --> 08:37.670
If they are captivated
by its radiant glow,

08:37.750 --> 08:38.870
how can one blame the moon

08:39.320 --> 08:40.320
for being too brilliant,

08:40.600 --> 08:41.600
too worthy of admiration?

08:42.416 --> 08:44.750
Your Highness, you are truly
a man of magnanimous heart.

09:02.600 --> 09:03.270
Assassin!

09:38.528 --> 09:39.840
Protect the Commandery Princess.

09:42.670 --> 09:43.320
Your Highness!

09:43.870 --> 09:44.510
Your Highness!

09:47.030 --> 09:47.630
Your Highness!

09:48.390 --> 09:50.080
They've taken Her Highness!

10:20.270 --> 10:20.960
Close the door.

10:20.960 --> 10:21.360
Got it.

10:23.750 --> 10:24.240
Move!

10:26.840 --> 10:28.080
Get the rope. Tie her up!

11:00.670 --> 11:01.600
Xihe, are you alright?

11:02.030 --> 11:02.750
I'm fine.

11:03.008 --> 11:05.088
I dosed them with some
muscle-softening incense.

11:15.320 --> 11:16.360
After all these years,

11:18.030 --> 11:19.120
I finally have the chance

11:20.550 --> 11:22.030
to spar with you, Huayong.

11:52.790 --> 11:53.360
Come on!

12:11.220 --> 12:12.900
(Yong)

12:15.660 --> 12:19.780
(Yong)

12:24.048 --> 12:25.940
If I hadn't suffered a
poison attack last time,

12:26.000 --> 12:27.320
and was still recovering,

12:27.856 --> 12:29.440
he wouldn't have been able to hurt me.

12:56.390 --> 12:57.390
Do you know

12:57.840 --> 12:58.870
that what happened today

12:58.960 --> 13:00.600
was connected
to Princess Ding Li Yanhui?

13:01.960 --> 13:02.870
How do you know?

13:03.024 --> 13:05.008
The falcon emblem
tattooed on their necks

13:05.150 --> 13:06.480
was the totem of Nanzhou.

13:09.440 --> 13:10.550
So that means

13:10.864 --> 13:13.030
when we ran into Li Yanhui
at the Lantern Festival,

13:13.390 --> 13:15.670
she wasn't just mourning her homeland.

13:17.270 --> 13:18.550
They were after me.

13:18.592 --> 13:20.200
This time, they changed their approach.

13:20.360 --> 13:21.440
They wanted to use you

13:21.630 --> 13:22.670
to bait me into their trap.

13:24.650 --> 13:25.840
Thankfully, you're unharmed.

13:25.936 --> 13:27.390
If you'd gotten hurt because of me...

13:27.390 --> 13:28.512
I wasn't doing it for you.

13:29.320 --> 13:31.790
Last time, Li Yanhui attacked
in the middle of a busy street

13:32.120 --> 13:33.550
and put innocent lives at risk.

13:33.680 --> 13:36.750
I've ordered the assassins to be brought
to the capital for interrogation.

13:37.030 --> 13:38.120
This time,

13:38.192 --> 13:39.760
Li Yanhui won't be able to get away.

13:40.150 --> 13:41.200
It's getting late.

13:41.790 --> 13:43.480
When do you plan to return to the manor?

13:45.720 --> 13:47.376
I'm staying somewhere for the night

13:47.408 --> 13:49.000
to wait for the flower to bloom.

13:49.000 --> 13:50.030
I'm not going back yet.

13:52.864 --> 13:53.910
Wait for a flower to bloom?

13:54.200 --> 13:57.030
I bought a Slender-Leaf Qionghua
at the market.

13:57.390 --> 13:58.670
It's an extremely rare flower.

13:58.790 --> 14:00.150
It only blooms at night,

14:00.510 --> 14:01.750
and its bloom is fleeting.

14:01.870 --> 14:03.550
It withers after just one night.

14:04.200 --> 14:05.600
I checked it in the carriage.

14:05.670 --> 14:06.670
If all goes well,

14:06.790 --> 14:08.120
it should bloom tonight.

14:09.480 --> 14:11.270
What's so special about this flower

14:11.360 --> 14:13.080
that you'd go to all this trouble?

14:13.080 --> 14:14.670
I just like its unique fragrance.

14:16.080 --> 14:17.200
Whether you stay or go

14:17.510 --> 14:19.030
is entirely up to you.

14:36.150 --> 14:36.910
Leave it here.

14:38.120 --> 14:39.270
There are two rooms here.

14:39.390 --> 14:40.270
I'll take one.

14:40.432 --> 14:42.150
Zhen Zhu and Mo Yu will share the other.

14:42.510 --> 14:44.120
Mo Yuan will keep watch outside.

14:44.320 --> 14:45.120
Your Highness...

14:45.120 --> 14:45.904
I get cold easily.

14:46.480 --> 14:47.790
I can't sleep in the carriage.

14:48.000 --> 14:49.200
It could trigger the poison.

14:50.390 --> 14:51.480
Would you

14:52.320 --> 14:53.600
mind sharing a room with me?

14:57.600 --> 14:58.200
Alright.

15:25.984 --> 15:28.000
You said you were waiting
for the flower to bloom.

15:28.750 --> 15:29.720
I didn't expect

15:30.550 --> 15:32.270
you to take it this seriously.

15:35.328 --> 15:37.200
I got some warming incense
from Zhen Zhu.

15:38.000 --> 15:39.000
The night's getting cold.

15:39.120 --> 15:40.320
Don't catch a chill.

15:40.440 --> 15:41.720
Thank you, Your Highness.

16:14.880 --> 16:17.950
♪Time passes like a dream♪

16:19.020 --> 16:21.630
♪Pushing the sea of
stars to flow across♪

16:23.070 --> 16:25.650
♪Flowers wilt and bloom again♪

16:26.100 --> 16:28.440
♪In an endless cycle♪

16:31.080 --> 16:34.000
♪Soft voices in the moonlight♪

16:34.540 --> 16:37.650
♪Gently spreading through the blossoms♪

16:38.450 --> 16:40.320
♪How sweet this yearning is♪

16:40.560 --> 16:45.000
♪Yet who among us still roams
like we did when we were young♪

16:46.960 --> 16:49.630
♪Amidst the flickering lights♪

16:50.440 --> 16:51.080
It moved!

16:51.080 --> 16:53.700
♪Alone for several autumns♪

16:55.090 --> 16:57.540
♪How to choose the one♪

16:57.920 --> 17:01.480
♪To be with forever?♪

17:02.560 --> 17:05.850
♪When I gaze upon you♪

17:06.480 --> 17:09.820
♪Flower petals twirl gently in my heart♪

17:10.300 --> 17:11.880
♪Gracefully♪

17:12.490 --> 17:17.650
♪For all eternity♪

17:18.090 --> 17:20.740
♪The timeless wind and moon♪

17:21.320 --> 17:24.930
♪Quietly reflect in your sparkling eyes♪

17:26.100 --> 17:28.840
♪Scattered red petals fall like rain♪

17:29.300 --> 17:33.140
♪It's a wonderful time in the world♪

17:34.080 --> 17:36.920
♪Bits of worries and sorrows♪

17:36.944 --> 17:38.040
♪Are gently gathered...♪

17:38.110 --> 17:38.640
There.

17:41.960 --> 17:43.680
Let's go back to the capital tomorrow.

18:13.640 --> 18:15.070
We're both equally pitiful.

18:25.680 --> 18:26.590
Changqing,

18:26.920 --> 18:28.440
why have you come to see me

18:28.640 --> 18:29.830
so early in the morning?

18:31.200 --> 18:32.270
Father,

18:32.790 --> 18:34.720
outside the capital yesterday,
I encountered

18:35.000 --> 18:36.400
a mysterious masked man.

18:36.720 --> 18:38.880
He was an exceptionally skilled fighter.

18:39.240 --> 18:40.550
After we exchanged blows,

18:40.640 --> 18:42.070
I realized

18:42.240 --> 18:43.030
that he was

18:43.510 --> 18:44.790
the Crown Prince.

18:46.200 --> 18:48.000
Huayong has always been frail.

18:49.720 --> 18:52.030
Since when is he a skilled fighter?

18:53.350 --> 18:54.510
Didn't you say

18:55.240 --> 18:56.640
he was masked

18:56.720 --> 18:58.350
and you couldn't see his face?

18:58.590 --> 19:00.640
How can you be so sure it was him?

19:00.640 --> 19:02.110
Huayong has an unmistakable bearing.

19:02.110 --> 19:03.270
I couldn't have mistaken him.

19:03.790 --> 19:04.680
Besides,

19:05.070 --> 19:06.510
he left something behind.

19:08.270 --> 19:09.350
I found it.

19:09.620 --> 19:11.860
(Yong)

19:12.830 --> 19:13.790
Bring it here.

19:20.030 --> 19:21.640
Father, have you ever wondered

19:21.880 --> 19:23.200
whether all those years away,

19:23.750 --> 19:27.000
he was truly recuperating
at Luotian Temple?

19:27.310 --> 19:28.880
Are you implying...

19:29.510 --> 19:30.790
Since the Crown Prince returned,

19:30.960 --> 19:32.920
Prince Kang, the Minister of Revenue,

19:32.920 --> 19:34.000
and the Duke of Ying

19:34.096 --> 19:35.480
have all been brought to justice.

19:36.550 --> 19:37.310
Surely...

19:38.510 --> 19:40.200
that deserves some thought.

19:42.510 --> 19:44.310
You think Huayong was behind it?

19:44.640 --> 19:45.680
I'd say

19:45.680 --> 19:47.440
you're letting your
imagination run wild.

19:47.680 --> 19:50.070
Is this because of Xihe?

19:50.070 --> 19:52.640
Do you still hold a grudge against him?

19:53.904 --> 19:55.400
If you don't believe me, Grandmother,

19:56.070 --> 19:57.310
I have more evidence.

19:58.110 --> 19:59.200
What evidence?

19:59.550 --> 20:00.720
Your Majesty!

20:03.350 --> 20:04.070
Your Majesty,

20:04.432 --> 20:05.480
something has happened

20:06.440 --> 20:07.640
to the Crown Prince.

20:08.620 --> 20:11.620
(East Palace)

20:11.920 --> 20:12.750
Huayong!

20:13.790 --> 20:14.510
Huayong!

20:15.680 --> 20:16.720
- I...
- Rise.

20:17.880 --> 20:18.680
- Huayong.
- I...

20:23.960 --> 20:25.550
What happened?

20:25.550 --> 20:26.880
Why did you suddenly faint?

20:28.920 --> 20:31.000
Yesterday, I felt a chill

20:31.400 --> 20:32.510
throughout my entire body.

20:32.880 --> 20:33.750
This morning,

20:33.750 --> 20:35.720
I went to soak in the
hot spring to ease it.

20:35.720 --> 20:37.270
I didn't realize I was so weak

20:38.480 --> 20:40.310
that the heat would make me pass out.

20:41.680 --> 20:44.830
I'm sorry I worried you and Father.

20:45.790 --> 20:48.070
I'm just glad you're alright.

20:48.270 --> 20:49.750
Yesterday,

20:50.352 --> 20:52.032
you stayed in the East Palace all day?

20:55.680 --> 20:56.440
Of course.

20:56.550 --> 20:57.880
Outside the capital yesterday,

20:58.680 --> 21:01.110
I encountered a highly skilled fighter.

21:01.480 --> 21:03.240
He dropped a jade pendant,

21:03.680 --> 21:05.030
and it belongs to you.

21:06.400 --> 21:07.960
How do you explain that?

21:11.720 --> 21:12.510
Changqing.

21:14.830 --> 21:16.270
Just look at me.

21:16.590 --> 21:18.920
I wish I were strong enough

21:19.550 --> 21:20.790
to leap across rooftops.

21:22.720 --> 21:24.160
You didn't answer my question.

21:24.920 --> 21:26.440
When I fought that man,

21:26.880 --> 21:29.400
I cut his left shoulder.

21:29.400 --> 21:31.568
If you are willing
to remove your clothes to prove it,

21:31.720 --> 21:34.270
all suspicion against you
will vanish completely.

21:35.000 --> 21:35.830
How preposterous!

21:36.350 --> 21:39.000
How can you ask Huayong to undress?

21:39.270 --> 21:40.030
Grandmother,

21:41.110 --> 21:42.960
I know you're protective of Huayong,

21:43.720 --> 21:45.000
but this is a serious matter.

21:45.480 --> 21:47.200
If Huayong simply shows his shoulder,

21:47.310 --> 21:48.720
the truth will come to light.

21:48.768 --> 21:50.016
What's so difficult about that?

21:58.000 --> 21:59.790
I can vouch for the Crown Prince.

22:12.270 --> 22:13.310
Greetings, Your Majesty.

22:14.000 --> 22:14.960
Greetings, Your Majesty.

22:17.200 --> 22:18.110
Xihe,

22:18.830 --> 22:20.790
how are you going to vouch for Huayong?

22:20.790 --> 22:22.200
From last night until this morning,

22:22.550 --> 22:25.070
His Highness was with me
the entire time.

22:25.310 --> 22:26.000
What?

22:26.720 --> 22:27.880
You and Huayong

22:28.680 --> 22:30.240
were together all night?

22:31.550 --> 22:32.480
Father.

22:33.880 --> 22:35.510
Xihe often looks after me.

22:35.552 --> 22:37.510
When she saw how badly
I felt the cold yesterday,

22:37.510 --> 22:38.830
she was worried about me,

22:39.088 --> 22:40.688
so she stayed the night at my palace.

22:42.830 --> 22:43.750
Changqing.

22:44.550 --> 22:45.590
Surely now

22:45.920 --> 22:47.640
you can put your doubts to rest.

22:54.720 --> 22:58.110
You two kept postponing
the wedding before,

22:58.680 --> 23:02.270
so I thought something
had come between you.

23:02.270 --> 23:05.400
It seems I was worrying for nothing.

23:05.590 --> 23:07.400
Since you love each other,

23:07.510 --> 23:09.510
the marriage should follow naturally.

23:09.680 --> 23:10.480
Your Majesty,

23:10.680 --> 23:13.590
have the Ministry of Rites
set a date tomorrow.

23:13.920 --> 23:14.920
Grandmother...

23:16.310 --> 23:17.030
I...

23:18.510 --> 23:20.030
still wish to postpone the wedding.

23:23.110 --> 23:24.000
Huayong.

23:25.480 --> 23:26.400
Didn't you

23:26.880 --> 23:29.240
want nothing more than to marry Xihe?

23:30.680 --> 23:31.920
What happened yesterday

23:33.030 --> 23:34.270
made me realize

23:35.160 --> 23:36.750
how frail I still am.

23:36.832 --> 23:38.448
How can she entrust her future to me?

23:39.200 --> 23:40.590
I don't want Xihe to worry,

23:41.000 --> 23:42.070
so I should

23:42.240 --> 23:43.640
take more time to recover.

23:44.256 --> 23:46.590
If you truly cared about
Commandery Princess Zhaoning,

23:48.070 --> 23:49.510
you'd call off the engagement.

23:49.590 --> 23:50.400
Insolence!

23:51.880 --> 23:53.350
You've gone too far.

23:53.640 --> 23:54.640
Grandmother,

23:56.030 --> 23:57.350
don't blame Changqing.

23:58.310 --> 23:59.510
Ever since he

23:59.790 --> 24:01.750
mistook Xihe for Gu Qingzhi,

24:02.110 --> 24:03.590
he's been obsessed.

24:06.880 --> 24:08.030
I left the palace as a child,

24:08.440 --> 24:10.550
so I was never close to my brothers.

24:11.510 --> 24:12.680
After I returned,

24:12.920 --> 24:14.350
I was always in poor health,

24:14.550 --> 24:16.270
so I could never join in their games.

24:17.000 --> 24:18.240
But I still remember

24:19.310 --> 24:20.790
one day when we were children,

24:21.160 --> 24:22.400
I watched through the window

24:23.160 --> 24:24.720
as my brothers played outside.

24:26.480 --> 24:27.720
Changqing

24:28.070 --> 24:30.270
secretly slipped me an osmanthus candy.

24:31.720 --> 24:33.400
I never thought that once we grew up,

24:33.750 --> 24:34.510
we would become

24:34.790 --> 24:36.160
such strangers.

24:38.790 --> 24:39.680
Alright, alright.

24:40.720 --> 24:41.750
That's enough.

24:42.400 --> 24:43.200
Huayong,

24:44.200 --> 24:45.240
we'll do as you wish.

24:49.350 --> 24:50.310
I didn't expect

24:50.830 --> 24:52.640
you'd ask to postpone the wedding.

24:56.440 --> 24:57.680
I don't want to force you,

24:58.680 --> 25:00.400
but I can't bring myself to call it off.

25:01.790 --> 25:03.310
This was the only compromise.

25:07.070 --> 25:08.830
I've never begged anyone,

25:10.112 --> 25:11.350
but I ask only this of you.

25:12.590 --> 25:13.960
Please give me a little more time.

25:19.020 --> 25:21.620
(Prince Ding's Manor)

25:27.960 --> 25:28.680
Cui Jinbai!

25:30.200 --> 25:31.310
How dare you!

25:31.520 --> 25:33.776
By what right do you come
to my manor to arrest my wife?

25:33.880 --> 25:34.790
What crime

25:35.350 --> 25:36.480
has she possibly committed?

25:37.000 --> 25:38.510
The assassins outside the capital

25:39.240 --> 25:41.400
were found bearing Nanzhou's emblem.

25:42.160 --> 25:43.350
They've confessed.

25:44.110 --> 25:45.000
His Majesty has ordered

25:45.184 --> 25:46.320
Princess Ding

25:46.340 --> 25:48.960
to assist with the investigation
at the Court of Judicial Review.

25:48.960 --> 25:49.720
What?

25:59.750 --> 26:01.790
His Majesty has arrived!

26:09.720 --> 26:11.830
The Court of Judicial Review found

26:12.480 --> 26:15.200
Prince Ding's military seal
at the assassins' hideout.

26:15.790 --> 26:17.480
Did Changtai give it to you?

26:17.880 --> 26:19.880
Prince Ding never guarded against me.

26:20.680 --> 26:21.960
Whatever I asked for,

26:22.350 --> 26:23.880
he gave me without hesitation.

26:24.160 --> 26:25.680
Getting the seal was easy.

26:25.680 --> 26:28.550
Since you knew how much he loved you,

26:29.240 --> 26:30.350
why did you

26:30.680 --> 26:32.550
betray his trust?

26:33.400 --> 26:34.720
I told him long ago

26:36.128 --> 26:37.750
that my heart held nothing but hatred,

26:38.510 --> 26:39.750
and that he shouldn't marry me.

26:41.200 --> 26:42.848
So how did I betray him?

26:42.850 --> 26:45.152
Victory and defeat, it's always
been the way of the world.

26:45.200 --> 26:46.240
Such is fate.

26:50.310 --> 26:52.000
I'm not one
of your empire's noble ladies.

26:53.310 --> 26:55.110
I don't have their grace or tolerance,

26:55.640 --> 26:56.960
nor do I understand fate.

26:57.880 --> 26:59.720
I only know that
I'm a princess of Nanzhou.

27:00.640 --> 27:02.000
You destroyed my kingdom

27:02.000 --> 27:03.550
and killed my parents.

27:05.240 --> 27:07.000
I'll never forgive you for that.

27:08.720 --> 27:11.720
Nanzhou had many princesses.

27:12.590 --> 27:14.790
How do you think you survived?

27:16.960 --> 27:18.310
Because you

27:19.030 --> 27:20.880
married me to Prince Ding.

27:22.270 --> 27:22.830
Yes.

27:24.110 --> 27:25.310
He treated me well.

27:26.830 --> 27:28.590
He knew nothing of my plans.

27:29.720 --> 27:31.550
I alone will bear the blame.

27:31.720 --> 27:34.480
Since you know your
crime is punishable by death,

27:35.480 --> 27:36.110
then I

27:37.310 --> 27:39.110
will grant you that death today.

27:40.680 --> 27:41.350
Wait!

27:42.960 --> 27:43.550
Father!

27:45.310 --> 27:45.830
Father!

27:48.830 --> 27:49.680
Please,

27:50.790 --> 27:52.000
spare Yanyan.

27:53.880 --> 27:54.960
Yanyan and I

27:56.310 --> 27:57.510
may have been

27:58.480 --> 28:00.070
matched by your decree,

28:01.030 --> 28:02.200
and between us

28:02.750 --> 28:04.240
stood the hatred of a fallen kingdom.

28:05.240 --> 28:06.480
But after we married,

28:08.310 --> 28:10.440
I came to love her with all my heart.

28:16.350 --> 28:17.240
Changtai,

28:18.680 --> 28:20.750
since you're pleading for her today,

28:22.680 --> 28:24.480
then perhaps this cup of poisoned liquor

28:25.270 --> 28:26.510
should be yours instead.

28:27.264 --> 28:28.830
Then please grant me the liquor, Father.

28:28.830 --> 28:29.680
Xiao Changtai!

28:36.310 --> 28:37.440
Xiao Changtai...

28:38.440 --> 28:39.000
Don't.

28:59.960 --> 29:00.640
Yanyan.

29:02.310 --> 29:03.350
It seems that in this life,

29:04.640 --> 29:05.880
I wasn't destined

29:06.440 --> 29:08.000
to grow old with you.

29:12.480 --> 29:13.350
Take care of yourself.

29:14.440 --> 29:15.440
Xiao Changtai!

29:27.270 --> 29:28.640
Xiao Changtai!

29:30.790 --> 29:31.590
No!

29:33.680 --> 29:34.350
No...

29:40.736 --> 29:43.110
Prince Ding really drank the
poisoned liquor for Li Yanhui.

29:43.590 --> 29:45.440
Is Prince Ding really
gone just like that?

29:46.240 --> 29:47.070
He won't die.

29:48.480 --> 29:50.590
If His Majesty punished
Li Yanhui too severely,

29:50.920 --> 29:52.240
it would alarm the other kingdoms.

29:52.830 --> 29:55.400
Even if foreign tribes wished to submit,

29:55.590 --> 29:56.830
they'd think twice.

29:57.270 --> 30:00.030
So His Majesty only
meant to teach her a lesson.

30:00.096 --> 30:02.200
He never intended to
kill her or Prince Ding.

30:02.200 --> 30:03.680
Your Highness, you knew all along.

30:03.952 --> 30:06.200
The liquor His Majesty gave
him wasn't poisoned at all.

30:06.310 --> 30:07.920
Prince Ding woke up soon afterward

30:07.920 --> 30:10.192
and has already been
taken back to his residence.

30:10.200 --> 30:11.110
Zhen Zhu.

30:12.240 --> 30:14.160
Since when did you learn
to keep me in suspense?

30:16.110 --> 30:18.510
But His Majesty ordered Li Yanhui

30:18.510 --> 30:19.790
not to leave the residence.

30:19.960 --> 30:21.400
The imperial princes

30:21.400 --> 30:22.960
may all be formidable men,

30:23.024 --> 30:24.790
but every one of them
is hopelessly devoted.

30:25.200 --> 30:26.920
Now that the wedding has been postponed,

30:27.160 --> 30:28.750
I wonder what the Crown Prince

30:28.750 --> 30:30.000
will do next.

30:33.100 --> 30:39.500
(Duke of Wei's Manor)

30:48.680 --> 30:52.640
Dry weather! Mind your fires!

30:55.200 --> 30:59.480
Dry weather! Mind your fires!

31:02.790 --> 31:06.880
Dry weather! Mind your fires!

31:21.790 --> 31:23.310
What are you doing here?

31:24.400 --> 31:25.680
Watching over her, of course.

31:27.480 --> 31:28.550
If you truly love her,

31:29.160 --> 31:30.680
you should keep it to yourself

31:31.680 --> 31:33.200
instead of disturbing her.

31:35.960 --> 31:37.880
Your wedding has been postponed.

31:39.000 --> 31:40.990
What makes you so confident
in saying this to me?

31:43.310 --> 31:44.830
Some things work out better with time.

31:45.510 --> 31:46.830
Are you really so sure

31:47.440 --> 31:48.590
she'll still marry you?

31:52.200 --> 31:53.790
I've never doubted it.

31:55.790 --> 31:57.960
She is my lawfully betrothed wife.

31:58.480 --> 31:59.240
Changqing,

31:59.880 --> 32:01.640
your wife has been gone for years.

32:02.064 --> 32:03.550
I don't want to see you like this.

32:03.550 --> 32:05.270
Spare me your noble excuses.

32:06.720 --> 32:07.920
The Crown Prince

32:08.384 --> 32:09.960
is trying to steal his brother's wife?

32:11.070 --> 32:12.400
What happened to your virtue,

32:12.590 --> 32:13.830
your kindness and devotion?

32:15.200 --> 32:16.736
Can't keep up the act anymore?

32:20.880 --> 32:22.720
She never loved you.

32:25.160 --> 32:27.270
So why act as though you've lost her?

32:59.550 --> 33:01.270
Zhaoning belongs only to herself.

33:03.240 --> 33:05.160
No one can take her away.

33:08.960 --> 33:11.160
She can only be won by her own choice.

33:56.720 --> 33:58.310
What have you come

33:59.550 --> 34:00.960
to ask of me today?

34:01.270 --> 34:02.680
Father,

34:02.752 --> 34:05.648
please end Crown Prince's engagement
to Commandery Princess Zhaoning.

34:11.590 --> 34:12.920
I didn't hear you clearly.

34:14.030 --> 34:15.110
Say that again.

34:18.280 --> 34:19.510
End their engagement.

34:19.510 --> 34:20.550
Absurd!

34:22.030 --> 34:23.960
I still can't let go of Her Highness.

34:24.880 --> 34:25.840
If I don't marry her,

34:25.952 --> 34:27.590
I'll regret it for the rest of my life.

34:27.590 --> 34:28.630
How dare you!

34:30.110 --> 34:31.230
Did you come here today

34:31.670 --> 34:33.590
expecting me to believe

34:33.760 --> 34:35.880
that Commandery Princess Zhaoning
is Gu Qingzhi

34:35.880 --> 34:37.320
and listen to that nonsense again?

34:37.400 --> 34:39.070
Then consider me mad, Father.

34:41.840 --> 34:43.110
Please grant my request.

34:58.880 --> 34:59.760
Changqing.

35:00.550 --> 35:02.190
Of all my sons,

35:02.670 --> 35:04.070
you command the greatest respect.

35:05.190 --> 35:06.000
You are also

35:07.000 --> 35:09.320
the son I value most.

35:09.480 --> 35:10.360
Huayong

35:10.550 --> 35:12.000
may be the Crown Prince,

35:12.320 --> 35:14.670
but he doesn't have long to live.

35:14.880 --> 35:15.760
For years now,

35:17.030 --> 35:18.800
my only wish

35:18.880 --> 35:20.360
has been for him

35:20.510 --> 35:21.800
to live as he pleases,

35:22.190 --> 35:23.510
happy and free of worry.

35:24.480 --> 35:25.710
But you're different.

35:26.230 --> 35:27.760
You know full well

35:28.590 --> 35:29.960
that for over the past decade,

35:30.070 --> 35:32.590
I've been grooming you

35:32.760 --> 35:34.760
as the true heir to the throne.

35:38.000 --> 35:39.630
But look at you now.

35:41.150 --> 35:42.510
Consumed by love,

35:42.960 --> 35:45.440
miserable every day,
with no ambition left.

35:45.800 --> 35:47.070
How can I possibly

35:48.030 --> 35:51.070
entrust this empire

35:51.070 --> 35:52.230
to someone like you?

35:53.760 --> 35:54.670
Back then,

35:55.840 --> 35:57.280
for Gu Qingzhi,

35:57.550 --> 35:59.110
you willingly clipped your own wings

35:59.590 --> 36:01.030
and vowed to mourn her for life.

36:01.190 --> 36:01.960
And now,

36:02.710 --> 36:04.840
are you going to give up the throne

36:05.070 --> 36:07.190
for Commandery Princess Zhaoning, too?

36:09.710 --> 36:10.960
My heart

36:11.150 --> 36:12.440
has never changed.

36:12.800 --> 36:13.190
You...

36:35.400 --> 36:36.670
Well, well, Changqing.

36:41.630 --> 36:42.840
Greetings, Prince Ning.

36:43.230 --> 36:45.320
Why are you guarding the palace gates?

36:48.150 --> 36:49.710
Word around the palace is

36:49.760 --> 36:52.190
you asked Father to let
you marry Commandery Princess Zhaoning

36:52.190 --> 36:53.590
and sent him into a rage.

36:53.760 --> 36:55.400
So the rumors are true.

37:00.550 --> 37:01.670
Guarding the palace

37:02.190 --> 37:03.280
is an important duty.

37:03.880 --> 37:05.960
Father is giving me a
chance to prove myself.

37:06.360 --> 37:07.630
Unlike you,

37:07.920 --> 37:09.360
who enjoys a generous salary

37:09.480 --> 37:10.896
and spends every day at leisure.

37:11.360 --> 37:13.190
Father must care for you deeply.

37:13.280 --> 37:15.000
All he wants is for you

37:15.190 --> 37:16.710
to live a peaceful, carefree life.

37:19.190 --> 37:21.110
Grandmother has just chosen

37:21.110 --> 37:23.320
the daughter of Vice Minister
Hu Zhengyang for me.

37:23.424 --> 37:25.320
The Hu family has been
prominent for generations

37:25.320 --> 37:27.150
and holds great influence at court.

37:27.230 --> 37:29.320
That shows how highly she values me.

37:31.710 --> 37:32.710
Then allow me

37:32.920 --> 37:34.110
to congratulate you.

37:34.630 --> 37:35.840
But then again,

37:36.030 --> 37:39.440
Commandery Princess Zhaoning has never
given you a second glance.

37:41.440 --> 37:42.400
Changqing,

37:43.480 --> 37:45.670
you've always been praised by everyone

37:45.670 --> 37:48.550
as a gifted man of
both letters and arms.

37:50.550 --> 37:51.760
How could you

37:52.710 --> 37:54.320
be so foolish?

38:14.230 --> 38:15.510
Greetings, Prince Xin.

38:16.976 --> 38:18.030
What are you doing here?

38:18.840 --> 38:20.280
Today is the day

38:20.440 --> 38:22.150
I pay my respects to
the Empress Dowager.

38:22.992 --> 38:24.496
I heard that for asking to marry me,

38:24.576 --> 38:27.480
His Majesty punished you by
making you guard the palace gates.

38:28.208 --> 38:30.160
Even if I were sent to
guard the imperial tombs

38:31.630 --> 38:33.000
or exiled to the frontier,

38:35.880 --> 38:37.150
I wouldn't complain.

38:43.800 --> 38:44.710
Are you willing

38:46.360 --> 38:47.710
to leave with me?

38:52.912 --> 38:55.280
We could leave the capital's
power struggles behind,

38:56.280 --> 38:57.320
withdraw from the world,

38:59.110 --> 39:00.760
and live a peaceful, free life.

39:02.720 --> 39:04.304
Even those with power and status

39:04.400 --> 39:05.710
must tread carefully.

39:07.230 --> 39:08.800
Why would becoming commoners

39:09.110 --> 39:10.630
guarantee peace and freedom?

39:10.960 --> 39:12.720
The Seven Sages of the Bamboo Grove

39:12.880 --> 39:14.030
turned their backs on society

39:14.464 --> 39:16.110
and lived as freely as they pleased.

39:16.800 --> 39:19.030
But how did they end up?

39:20.110 --> 39:20.920
Escaping the world

39:21.670 --> 39:23.320
is nothing but self-deception.

39:26.480 --> 39:27.070
Your Highness.

39:30.150 --> 39:31.190
Prince Xin,

39:32.000 --> 39:34.630
even if you asked me a thousand times,

39:35.190 --> 39:36.590
my answer would still be no.

39:46.180 --> 39:49.740
(Favorable Weather)

39:52.480 --> 39:54.150
I wish to report corruption!

39:54.192 --> 39:56.110
(Corrupt Appointments and Fraud)
Someone bribed the evaluating official,

39:56.144 --> 39:57.440
altered the candidate rankings,

39:57.710 --> 39:58.880
smuggled notes into the exam,

39:59.030 --> 40:00.280
and cheated!

40:00.630 --> 40:02.960
The newly appointed top
candidate is an ignorant fraud

40:03.150 --> 40:04.960
who has deceived everyone!

40:05.760 --> 40:07.590
I wish to report corruption!

40:08.000 --> 40:09.536
Someone bribed the evaluating official

40:09.568 --> 40:11.150
(Favorable Weather)
and altered the candidate rankings!

40:11.150 --> 40:12.710
There was cheating in the exam!

40:13.400 --> 40:16.230
I heard this year's top
candidate is barely qualified

40:16.230 --> 40:17.550
and bought his way in.

40:18.360 --> 40:21.000
Nothing matters more than scholarship.

40:21.150 --> 40:23.710
We've never heard of
exam fraud in this dynasty.

40:23.710 --> 40:25.760
But these shocking rumors

40:25.760 --> 40:27.360
are so detailed

40:27.360 --> 40:28.800
that they're hard not to believe.

40:29.400 --> 40:30.710
Who's the new top candidate?

40:31.150 --> 40:32.150
His surname is He.

40:32.176 --> 40:34.550
He's a distant relative of the
Imperial Academy Chancellor.

40:38.670 --> 40:40.070
Someone has accused you

40:40.630 --> 40:42.360
of bribing the examiner

40:42.510 --> 40:43.840
and being unworthy of your rank.

40:44.920 --> 40:46.590
Today, I'll set the question myself

40:47.360 --> 40:48.800
and test you personally.

41:18.800 --> 41:20.590
This is utter nonsense!

41:21.056 --> 41:22.880
You're nothing but an incompetent fool!

41:24.304 --> 41:25.590
Please calm down, Your Majesty.

41:25.920 --> 41:27.400
I failed in my duty as proctor.

41:27.630 --> 41:28.630
I accept my guilt.

41:29.070 --> 41:31.230
Tell us exactly how you cheated.

41:31.400 --> 41:32.400
Leave nothing out.

41:32.670 --> 41:34.760
I happened to meet a scholar

41:35.190 --> 41:36.550
who was exceptionally talented.

41:36.880 --> 41:38.550
But his grandfather had passed away,

41:38.960 --> 41:39.840
so he was in mourning

41:40.320 --> 41:42.000
and couldn't sit this
year's examination.

41:42.010 --> 41:44.360
So I gave him the question
and asked him to draft an answer.

41:44.360 --> 41:47.360
Then I memorized it word for word.

41:47.480 --> 41:48.672
Have mercy, Your Majesty!

41:48.920 --> 41:50.840
How did you get the exam question?

41:54.190 --> 41:54.590
The...

41:55.440 --> 41:56.464
The exam question...

42:06.230 --> 42:06.880
Your Highness.

42:07.840 --> 42:09.440
Prince Xin has openly

42:09.440 --> 42:11.216
asked His Majesty for
Her Highness's hand.

42:11.760 --> 42:13.590
Yet you're still sitting here so calmly.

42:14.070 --> 42:16.110
Aren't you afraid he'll steal her away?

42:19.030 --> 42:20.550
Rather than worry,

42:20.670 --> 42:22.190
I'd rather focus on what matters.

42:23.280 --> 42:24.880
You mean the exam fraud case?

42:26.320 --> 42:27.000
That's right.

42:29.480 --> 42:30.860
Why don't we use this chance

42:30.870 --> 42:32.110
to promote a few more of them?

42:32.110 --> 42:33.280
We'd gain more capable people

42:33.480 --> 42:35.190
and uncover who's behind this.

42:36.224 --> 42:37.472
If their ranks are too low,

42:37.504 --> 42:39.490
they won't investigate
anyone close to the throne.

42:41.480 --> 42:42.320
No need.

42:44.630 --> 42:46.710
They all come from humble families

42:47.190 --> 42:48.710
with no connections at court.

42:49.480 --> 42:50.960
I've given them a chance,

42:51.190 --> 42:52.440
but from here on,

42:52.440 --> 42:54.190
they must make their own way

42:54.190 --> 42:55.670
and prove what they're capable of.

42:55.920 --> 42:58.000
Only then will they earn their place.

43:12.920 --> 43:14.230
Say what's on your mind.

43:14.920 --> 43:15.960
I just feel that

43:16.480 --> 43:18.150
you used to act decisively,

43:18.960 --> 43:21.230
rather than take things
step by step like this.

43:23.190 --> 43:24.150
Back then,

43:25.230 --> 43:27.030
all I wanted was to find

43:27.104 --> 43:28.960
who poisoned me as quickly as possible.

43:29.920 --> 43:30.760
But now,

43:32.670 --> 43:34.440
I want to think about
what's best for Xihe.

43:43.590 --> 43:46.070
Although Yunhuai has
gone beyond the frontier

43:46.070 --> 43:47.440
to seek treatment for me,

43:47.800 --> 43:49.110
I'm still not sure

43:49.480 --> 43:51.110
I'll survive what's coming.

43:51.360 --> 43:53.030
I never should've drawn Xihe into this.

43:53.840 --> 43:56.230
She deserves someone
who can stay with her longer.

43:58.000 --> 43:59.440
But I can't let her go.

44:00.550 --> 44:02.590
For this selfish desire of mine,

44:04.000 --> 44:05.510
all I can do is make it up to her.

44:07.280 --> 44:09.190
So everything you're doing now

44:10.150 --> 44:11.360
is for Her Highness?

44:15.070 --> 44:16.760
Xihe cares deeply about the northwest,

44:17.360 --> 44:19.110
and wants control over her own fate.

44:20.880 --> 44:22.400
Then I'll do everything I can

44:22.590 --> 44:24.150
to clear every path for her.

44:29.230 --> 44:30.480
Even if, in the end,

44:31.230 --> 44:32.630
I'm no longer by her side,

44:33.510 --> 44:36.360
she'll still have loyal officials
supporting her at court,

44:36.880 --> 44:37.960
and she'll be able

44:38.800 --> 44:40.110
to live the life she wants.

44:47.020 --> 44:51.340
(Taiji Hall)

44:51.360 --> 44:52.360
Talent

44:53.340 --> 44:54.960
is the foundation of a nation.

44:55.400 --> 44:56.960
Only with capable people in office

44:57.110 --> 44:58.480
can the people

44:58.512 --> 45:00.230
be educated and taught proper conduct.

45:00.670 --> 45:02.360
This examination fraud case

45:03.480 --> 45:05.230
is extremely serious.

45:05.248 --> 45:06.976
It must be thoroughly investigated.

45:07.008 --> 45:07.840
Ministers,

45:08.670 --> 45:09.670
is anyone willing

45:09.960 --> 45:11.880
to take on this responsibility?

45:23.190 --> 45:24.880
Not one official in this court

45:25.960 --> 45:27.590
has the courage

45:28.280 --> 45:30.320
to take on this difficult task?

45:47.400 --> 45:48.150
Father.

45:48.840 --> 45:49.880
I'll do it.

46:03.440 --> 46:04.230
Now,

46:04.256 --> 46:06.000
I don't even have
three or five years left.

46:06.230 --> 46:07.510
How much time do you have?

46:07.800 --> 46:08.320
A year.

46:08.710 --> 46:10.000
For that one year,

46:10.150 --> 46:11.800
I'll be a good wife to you.

46:12.512 --> 46:14.440
Each dawn, each dusk,
each moment together,

46:14.440 --> 46:15.440
that will be a lifetime.

46:15.450 --> 46:18.140
(An Auspicious Day for Marriage)
I chose the nearest auspicious date.

46:18.150 --> 46:20.192
The bridal procession
from the East Palace is here!

46:25.430 --> 46:28.370
♪I've hidden so many words♪

46:28.990 --> 46:31.790
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

46:32.660 --> 46:39.630
♪So never uncover♪

46:39.820 --> 46:42.180
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

46:43.310 --> 46:46.040
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

46:47.000 --> 46:52.340
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

46:54.100 --> 46:56.920
♪Every answer I gave♪

46:57.720 --> 47:00.570
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

47:01.360 --> 47:04.730
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

47:04.990 --> 47:08.300
♪How hard it truly was?♪

47:11.270 --> 47:14.710
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

47:15.700 --> 47:18.030
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

47:19.300 --> 47:25.060
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

47:26.470 --> 47:29.600
♪It's a shame I never could♪

47:30.050 --> 47:33.060
♪Give you a moon in return♪

47:33.170 --> 47:39.810
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

47:39.810 --> 47:43.480
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

47:44.350 --> 47:47.110
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

47:47.550 --> 47:50.680
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

47:51.120 --> 47:57.070
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

47:58.470 --> 48:02.020
♪You'll never♪

48:02.300 --> 48:11.770
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

48:37.940 --> 48:41.420
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
